1
00:05:11,538 --> 00:05:17,538
From gamer to racer.

2
00:10:23,076 --> 00:10:29,076
Gran Turismo is a adventure, action, drama film directed by Neill Blomkamp.

3
00:15:34,615 --> 00:15:40,615
The ultimate wish-fulfillment tale of a teenage Gran Turismo player whose gaming skills won him a
series of Nissan competitions to become an actual professional racecar driver.

4
00:20:46,153 --> 00:20:52,153
Jann Mardenborough, played by Archie Madekwe.

5
00:25:57,692 --> 00:26:03,692
Jack Salter, played by David Harbour.

6
00:31:09,230 --> 00:31:15,230
Danny Moore, played by Orlando Bloom.

7
00:36:20,769 --> 00:36:26,769
Steve Mardenborough, played by Djimon Hounsou.

8
00:41:32,307 --> 00:41:38,307
Matty Davis, played by Darren Barnet.

9
00:46:43,846 --> 00:46:49,846
Audrey, played by Maeve Courtier-Lilley.

10
00:51:55,384 --> 00:52:01,384
Gran Turismo is a 2023 American biographical sports drama film based on the
sim racing video game series developed by Polyphony Digital.

11
00:57:06,923 --> 00:57:12,923
Produced by Columbia Pictures, PlayStation Productions, and 2.0 Entertainment, the film was
directed by Neill Blomkamp from a screenplay by Jason Hall and Zach Baylin.

12
01:02:18,461 --> 01:02:24,461
It depicts a sensationalized account of real life British driver Jann Mardenborough, a
teenage Gran Turismo player who became a professional racing car driver.

13
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The film stars Archie Madekwe as Mardenborough, alongside David Harbour, Orlando
Bloom, Darren Barnet, Geri Halliwell Horner, and Djimon Hounsou.

14
01:12:41,538 --> 01:12:47,538
Development of a film based on Gran Turismo was revealed in July 2013, with Michael
De Luca and Dana Brunetti producing and Alex Tse writing the script.

15
01:17:53,076 --> 01:17:59,076
Joseph Kosinski was set to direct the film in June 2015 from
a new screenplay by Jon and Erich Hoeber.

16
01:23:04,615 --> 01:23:10,615
However, the Kosinski version was no longer moving forward as of February 2018.

17
01:28:16,153 --> 01:28:22,153
In May 2022, it was announced the film was again in development,
with Blomkamp being attached to direct it in June.

18
01:33:27,692 --> 01:33:33,692
The main cast were announced in September 2022, while
other cast additions signed in November.

19
01:38:39,230 --> 01:38:45,230
Filming began in Hungary that month and wrapped in December.

20
01:43:50,769 --> 01:43:56,769
The film score was composed by Lorne Balfe and Andrew Kawczynski.

21
01:49:02,307 --> 01:49:08,307
Gran Turismo premiered at the Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps in Belgium on July 30, 2023, and was
released in the United States on August 25 by Columbia Pictures via Sony Pictures Releasing.

22
01:54:13,846 --> 01:54:19,846
It has grossed $122 million worldwide against its $60 million budget and received mixed reviews from critics, who praised Blomkamp's direction and
racing sequences, but criticized its writing and use of Mardenborough's crash at the Nürburgring Nordschleife as a narrative element.

23
01:59:25,384 --> 01:59:31,384
The film was nominated for "Best Adaptation" at The Game Awards 2023.

24
02:04:36,923 --> 02:04:42,923
The film explores themes of sports, based on true story,
racing, based on video game, duringcreditsstinger.

25
02:09:48,461 --> 02:09:54,461
The tone is emotional.
